# Typecheck and test before anything leaves the machine.
#
# pre-commit only runs lint-staged (ESLint + Prettier on changed files), so a
# type error or a failing test could previously reach the remote unnoticed —
# there was no CI either. Kept off pre-commit deliberately: a full typecheck on
# every commit is slow enough to encourage --no-verify, which defeats the point.
pnpm typecheck
pnpm test
